# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Build output. `--out` takes an arbitrary directory, so these are the two
# defaults only: `./structurizr-output` from `pnpm build` and `./output` from
# the older scripts. Anchored, and directories, on purpose — the pattern used
# to be `*output`, which also swallows any file whose name happens to end in
# "output" anywhere in the tree.
/structurizr-output/
/output/

# Wrong-package-manager lockfiles. pnpm-lock.yaml is the lockfile; npm and yarn
# will happily produce a second one and drift it (see CONTRIBUTING.md).
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# `npm pack` output
*.tgz

# Local assistant / tooling scratch. None of it is project state, none of it is
# reproducible from this repository, and all of it is machine-local — so it is
# ignored rather than committed. Anchored to the root, because these names are
# only ever created there.
#
# Listed by name on purpose. The alternative — leaving them out and relying on a
# personal global gitignore — means every contributor who uses one of these
# tools sees them in `git status` and one of them eventually commits a
# directory of local scratch into a public repository. One line each is cheaper
# than that.
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.playwright-mcp/
/skills-lock.json

.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Editor directories and files
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.dot*
